Description: Round all four window corners and draw soft shadows with SceneFX
 Labwc rounds only the top corners of server-side decorations, with cairo
 images, and draws drop shadows from cairo gradients that assume a square
 bottom. This patch rounds every corner with SceneFX and replaces the shadow
 images with a SceneFX shadow node, for windows with server-side and with
 client-side decorations.
 .
 Corners: each client buffer that covers a corner of the window gets the
 radius for that corner (SceneFX rounds per buffer), so subsurfaces at the
 window edge are rounded and those inside it are not. With server-side
 decorations the content gets the inner radius below the border, and the
 bottom border rect is rounded on the outside with the window area clipped
 out; the top corners stay the titlebar's cairo images. Window captures
 (ext-image-copy-capture of a toplevel) are rounded on all four sides.
 Maximized, fullscreen and tiled windows keep square corners, as Labwc
 squares the titlebar for them. Clients that draw their own frame (the main
 surface sticks out of the window geometry, as GTK4 does for its shadow and
 resize margin) are left alone.
 .
 Shadows: one SceneFX shadow node per window, below the decorations, the
 window outline grown by window.*.shadow.size and moved by the new theme keys
 window.*.shadow.offset.x/y (default 0); the outline is clipped out, so
 nothing is drawn under translucent windows. Same rules as before for
 maximized, fullscreen and tiled windows (dropShadowsOnTiled).
 .
 Known limits: single-pixel buffers are not rounded by SceneFX 0.5; the
 shadow blur is not scaled with the output scale; Alt-Tab thumbnails stay
 square; a shaded window keeps a square titlebar bottom.
 .
 Defaults are unchanged (cornerRadius 8, dropShadows no). The radii and the
 buffer walk run once per output frame, which also catches subsurfaces that
 clients add on their own; SceneFX ignores setters that change nothing.
 .
 Upstream Labwc declined SceneFX (labwc/labwc pull request 3751), so this is
 carried downstream.
Author: The Dodobian authors
Origin: vendor, https://github.com/dodobian/dodobian/tree/main/labwc
Forwarded: not-needed
